  "key": "2",
  "html": "<section class=\"filings\" aria-label=\"제출 이력\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h3>비공개 초안 여섯 번, 공개본 한 번<small>SEC 전자공시시스템(EDGAR) 제출 이력 <button class=\"cite ext\" data-f=\"edgar-hist\"></button></small></h3>\n    <div class=\"ftrack\" id=\"ftrack\">\n      <div class=\"f\"><b></b><div class=\"t\">DRS</div><div class=\"n\">비공개 초안</div><div class=\"d\">06.01</div></div>\n      <div class=\"f\"><b></b><div class=\"t\">DRS/A</div><div class=\"n\">비공개 수정 초안</div><div class=\"d\">07.13</div></div>\n      <div class=\"f\"><b></b><div class=\"t\">DRS/A</div><div class=\"n\">비공개 수정 초안</div><div class=\"d\">08.10</div></div>\n      <div class=\"f\"><b></b><div class=\"t\">DRS/A</div><div class=\"n\">비공개 수정 초안</div><div class=\"d\">09.04</div></div>\n      <div class=\"f\"><b></b><div class=\"t\">DRS/A</div><div class=\"n\">비공개 수정 초안</div><div class=\"d\">10.01</div></div>\n      <div class=\"f\"><b></b><div class=\"t\">DRS/A</div><div class=\"n\">비공개 수정 초안</div><div class=\"d\">10.09</div></div>\n      <div class=\"f pub\"><b></b><div class=\"t\">S-1</div><div class=\"n\">공개 증권신고서</div><div class=\"d\">10.26</div></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- CH1 -->\n"
